/// The front page, in Blueprint (`HomeShell`): what WebFluent is and how to
/// start, an example beside it, the six outputs, the cheat sheets, the four
/// kinds of page and the install line.
page Home(path: "/", title: "WebFluent — websites, PDFs and slide decks from one language", description: "A typed language and one binary that build a static site, a single-page app, a PDF or a slide deck. No Node, no bundler, no config.") {
    HomeShell
}
